        <h2 class="subtitle" data-en="The Three Inevitable Flaws of Deepfakes" data-es="Los Tres Fallos Inevitables del Deepfake">The Three Inevitable Flaws of Deepfakes</h2>
        <p class="info" data-en="Artificial intelligence (AI) excels at creating the ''what'' (the main face), but it consistently makes mistakes in the ''how'' and the ''where'' (the environment, physics, and fine details). Focus on these three ''fingerprints'' that AI leaves behind." data-es="La Inteligencia Artificial (IA) es excelente para crear el ''qué'' (el rostro principal), pero constantemente comete errores en el ''cómo'' y el ''dónde'' (el entorno, la física y los detalles finos). Concéntrate en estas tres ''huellas dactilares'' que la IA deja."><span style="padding-left: 30px;"></span>Artificial intelligence (AI) excels at creating the "what" (the main face), but it consistently makes mistakes in the "how" and the "where" (the environment, physics, and fine details). Focus on these three "fingerprints" that AI leaves behind.</p>
      </div>
