        <h2 class="subtitle" data-en="2. Legal and Regulatory Pillar: Punishment and Deterrence Framework" data-es="2. Pilar Legal y Regulatorio: Marco de Castigo y Disuasión">2. Legal and Regulatory Pillar: Punishment and Deterrence Framework</h2>
        <ul class="info-list">
          <li>
            <strong class="info" data-en="Criminal Liability Laws:" data-es="Leyes de Responsabilidad Penal:">Criminal Liability Laws:</strong>
            <p class="info" data-en="Implementation of laws that define and severely punish the malicious use of Deepfakes (fraud, extortion, PNCP), establishing clear criminal liability for creators and distributors." data-es="Implementación de leyes que definan y castiguen severamente el uso malicioso del Deepfake (fraude, extorsión, PNCP), estableciendo una clara responsabilidad penal para los creadores y distribuidores.">Implementation of laws that define and severely punish the malicious use of Deepfakes (fraud, extortion, PNCP), establishing clear criminal liability for creators and distributors.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="info" data-en="Labeling required by law:" data-es="Etiquetado Obligatorio por Ley:">Labeling required by law:</strong>
            <p class="info" data-en="Regulatory proposals that require all content generated or significantly modified by AI to be clearly labeled as ''Synthetic'' or ''AI-generated'' to prevent deception." data-es="Propuestas regulatorias que exigen que todo contenido generado o modificado significativamente por IA deba ser claramente etiquetado como ''Sintético'' o ''Generado por IA'' para evitar engaños.">Regulatory proposals that require all content generated or significantly modified by AI to be clearly labeled as "Synthetic" or "AI-generated" to prevent deception.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="info" data-en="Victim Protection:" data-es="Protección de Víctimas:">Victim Protection:</strong>
            <p class="info" data-en="Creation of agile legal mechanisms that allow victims of identity theft (especially PNCP) to request the immediate removal of content from all platforms." data-es="Creación de mecanismos legales ágiles que permitan a las víctimas de suplantación de identidad (especialmente PNCP) solicitar la eliminación inmediata del contenido de todas las plataformas.">Creation of agile legal mechanisms that allow victims of identity theft (especially PNCP) to request the immediate removal of content from all platforms.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
