        <h2 class="subtitle" data-en="1. Technological Pillar: Combating AI with AI" data-es="1. Pilar Tecnológico: Combatiendo la IA con IA">1. Technological Pillar: Combating AI with AI</h2>
        <ul class="info-list">
          <li>
            <strong class="info" data-en="Forensic AI Detection:" data-es="Detección de IA Forense:">Forensic AI Detection:</strong>
            <p class="info" data-en="Development of Artificial Intelligence algorithms specialized in identifying the microscopic ''fingerprints'' and anomalous patterns that GAN (Generative Adversarial Network) models leave in content. These detectors operate at a pixel scale that the human eye cannot see." data-es="Desarrollo de algoritmos de Inteligencia Artificial especializados en identificar las ''huellas dactilares'' microscópicas y los patrones anómalos que los modelos GAN (Redes Generativas Adversariales) dejan en el contenido. Estos detectores actúan a una escala de píxeles que el ojo humano no puede ver.">Development of Artificial Intelligence algorithms specialized in identifying the microscopic "fingerprints" and anomalous patterns that GAN (Generative Adversarial Network) models leave in content. These detectors operate at a pixel scale that the human eye cannot see.</p>
          </li>          
          <li>
            <strong class="info" data-en="Content Authentication (Proof of Origin):" data-es="Autenticación de Contenido (Prueba de Origen):">Content Authentication (Proof of Origin):</strong>
            <p class="info" data-en="The industry is driving the creation of standards to prove that content is genuine. Systems (such as the C2PA initiative) attach an immutable record to the file certifying who recorded it, when, and with what device. Similarly, invisible digital watermarks guarantee that the content has not been modified or, if it has, indicate which parts are synthetic." data-es="La industria está impulsando la creación de estándares para demostrar que un contenido es genuino. Sistemas (como la iniciativa C2PA) que adjuntan un registro inmutable al archivo que certifica quién, cuándo y con qué dispositivo se grabó originalmente. Asi como las Marcas de Agua Sellos digitales invisibles que garantizan que el contenido no ha sido modificado o, si lo ha sido, indican qué partes son sintéticas.">The industry is driving the creation of standards to prove that content is genuine. Systems (such as the C2PA initiative) attach an immutable record to the file certifying who recorded it, when, and with what device. Similarly, invisible digital watermarks guarantee that the content has not been modified or, if it has, indicate which parts are synthetic.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="info" data-en="Active Elimination:" data-es="Eliminación Activa:">Active Elimination:</strong>
            <p class="info" data-en="Automated tools implemented by social media platforms to identify and remove harmful deepfake content in a matter of minutes, neutralizing its ability to spread rapidly." data-es="Herramientas automatizadas implementadas por plataformas sociales para identificar y retirar contenido deepfake dañino en cuestión de minutos, neutralizando su capacidad de viralización rápida.">Automated tools implemented by social media platforms to identify and remove harmful deepfake content in a matter of minutes, neutralizing its ability to spread rapidly.</p>
          </li>  
        </ul>
